; One variable: blend_mode = 1 (Add) on two overlapping Sprite2Ds under one textured PointLight2D, over
; an opaque unlit Polygon2D. Godot's lit path does no sRGB conversion, so each item lands within one
; level of the reference. The opaque Polygon2D keeps the clear colour out of the lit pixels.

